- **2026-08-03 — Kaggle ops (Class 9 Science textbook test, 301 MB / 1299 pages):** Full PDF still uploads to Kaggle even with “Test first pages only” (page range limits **extract** only). **`EXTRACT_PROVIDER=local`** recommended for laptop dev (skip 76-chunk Kaggle upload; ~3 min local extract for 15–20 pages). **`CHAPTERWISE_TOPIC_CHUNK_PAGES=8`** reduces Llama VRAM per chunk. **`KAGGLE_API_SECRET`** must match notebook cell 2 exactly (placeholder causes 401). **`HF_TOKEN`** + Hugging Face gated access required for Llama (“Expand to review and access” on model page; affiliation can be `Individual`). Set notebook `CHAPTERWISE_LLM_PRELOAD=1`, `CHAPTERWISE_LLM_4BIT=1`, lower `MAX_INPUT_CHARS` / `MAX_NEW_TOKENS` to avoid CUDA OOM on T4. Cloudflare tunnel dies mid-session (502 / error 1033) — refresh URL each notebook run. First successful `/debug/text` after preload: `"ok": true`, `"llm_loaded": true`. Sample born-digital NCERT-style PDF pages extract well with pdfplumber (no GPU OCR needed for v1).
- **2026-08-10 — Extract perf (header/footer):** `pdf_extract.py` header/footer scan was parsing all 1299 pages even for `page_start=1&page_end=10` (~93s of ~98s). Fixed: sample **36 evenly spaced pages** + cache by file fingerprint. Pages 1–10 local extract dropped to ~6–8s. Added `CHAPTERWISE_DEBUG_TIMING=1`. Laptop `CHAPTERWISE_TEXT_EXTRACTOR=rapidocr`, `CHAPTERWISE_RAPIDOCR_FORCE=0`.
- **2026-08-10 — Topic build OOM + tunnel 502:** Llama 1B on T4 OOM during `/chat/completions` when prompt + `max_new_tokens=4096` spiked attention (~13 GB). Pattern: first call often succeeds; **JSON retry** (bad output + full chunk) triggers CUDA OOM or Cloudflare **502 Bad gateway** (tunnel loses Kaggle mid-request). Fixes: `llm_server.py` — defaults `MAX_NEW_TOKENS=1024`, `MAX_INPUT_CHARS=12000`, truncate **all** messages to total budget, assistant cap 2000, `empty_cache()` after generate, `repetition_penalty=1.2`. `topic_builder.py` — retry assistant capped at `CHAPTERWISE_TOPIC_RETRY_CHARS=2000`. `main.py` — `/build_topics` uses `CHAPTERWISE_TOPIC_CHUNK_PAGES` from env (not hardcoded 18). Republished `eakeswar/chapterwise-models`. Topic prompt tightened (Activity rules, section limits, anti-leak example); sanity warnings for bad trees. Tree quality on Class 9 Science OCR still rough (fabricated subsections, parallel “chapters” for 1.1/1.2).

