## 8. Explicit non-goals for v1 (flag as `# TODO v2`)

- No **Azure** chat fallback when `TEXT_PROVIDER=kaggle` — Kaggle Llama handles topic text; TTS/images stay on Azure
- No karaoke word highlighting — play/pause audio per topic only
- No image **generation** for formula/diagram images — Lanczos upscale only for informational images; `gpt-image-2` only for small/blurry **decorative** images (step 7)
- No multi-user auth — single active document
- No vector DB — topic Q&A uses raw topic text in prompt context
- No disk caching — in-memory only
- No OpenAI for full-book PDF parsing (local extract first; hybrid vision fallback is v2)

