### `/ask` + `AskPanel`

- `qa.py`: topic explanation + raw source text in context; refuse to guess outside topic

### `/tts` + Listen

- ✅ `tts.py` + `POST /tts` on `AZURE_TTS_BASE_URL` (services endpoint)
- ✅ Listen button in `TopicView` (explanation text, fallback to source text)
- ⬜ Optional: `POST /tts` with `{ topic_id }` after explanation exists

### `image_enhance.py` (§4a)

- ✅ `generate_decorative_image()` via `gpt-image-2` (smoke-tested)
- ⬜ Classify informational vs decorative (Veda-style heuristics: overlapWordCount, aspect/area)
- ⬜ Quality: small (< 400px) or blurry (Laplacian variance < 100)
- ⬜ Route: informational → **Lanczos only**; decorative + low quality → `gpt-image-2` (never regenerate formulas)
- ⬜ In-memory cache keyed by image hash

